{"chars": "First comes the bakery, the Gingerbread Oven, run by Hazel Crumb, the head baker. Hazel is round and rosy as a fresh-baked bun, with warm brown skin and curly gray hair tucked under a tall white baker's hat, a red-and-white striped apron covered in floury handprints, and sleeves always rolled up to her elbows. She hums while she kneads the dough, and she always has a dusting of flour on the tip of her nose, which she never seems to notice. Its windows are fogged with warm steam, and the air smells of cinnamon, brown sugar and fresh bread. Next door is the candy shop, where elves pull long, stretchy ropes of peppermint and twist them into red-and-white stripes. Then the ribbon shop, run by Fern, a quick, quiet elf with two long black braids tied with green ribbon, and a rainbow of ribbons tied around her wrists, so she can always grab the right one in a hurry. Its shelves are stacked with spools of ribbon in every color, gold and silver, plaid and polka-dot, and the crinkle-crinkle of wrapping paper drifting out the door.", "start": [0.275, 0.275, 0.275, 0.275, 0.275, 0.575, 0.575, 0.575, 0.575, 0.575, 0.575, 0.875, 0.875, 0.875, 0.875, 0.975, 0.975, 0.975, 0.975, 0.975, 0.975, 0.975, 1.65, 1.75, 1.75, 1.75, 1.75, 1.875, 1.875, 1.875, 1.875, 1.875, 1.875, 1.875, 1.875, 1.875, 1.875, 1.875, 1.875, 2.425, 2.425, 2.425, 2.425, 2.425, 2.95, 3.05, 3.05, 3.05, 3.05, 3.275, 3.275, 3.275, 3.45, 3.45, 3.45, 3.45, 3.45, 3.45, 3.837, 3.837, 3.837, 3.837, 3.837, 3.837, 4.375, 4.475, 4.475, 4.475, 4.475, 4.575, 4.575, 4.575, 4.575, 4.575, 4.8, 4.8, 4.8, 4.8, 4.8, 4.8, 5.625, 5.787, 5.787, 5.787, 5.787, 5.787, 5.787, 6.15, 6.15, 6.15, 6.3, 6.3, 6.3, 6.3, 6.3, 6.3, 6.675, 6.675, 6.675, 6.675, 6.8, 6.8, 6.8, 6.8, 6.8, 7.175, 7.175, 7.175, 7.287, 7.287, 7.362, 7.362, 7.362, 7.362, 7.362, 7.362, 7.362, 7.362, 7.362, 7.362, 7.362, 7.362, 7.938, 7.938, 7.938, 7.938, 8.55, 8.65, 8.65, 8.65, 8.65, 8.65, 8.838, 8.838, 8.838, 8.838, 8.838, 9.15, 9.15, 9.15, 9.15, 9.15, 9.15, 9.48